 "days": [
  {
   "day": 1,
   "title": "Arrival in Oslo | Welcome to the Capital of Norway",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "Upon reaching Oslo airport, meet the representative who will take you to your pre-booked hotel. Proceed with the check-in formalities and spend the rest of the day at leisure. You can spend the day exploring its rich cultural heritage. Visit the iconic Viking Ship Museum, stroll through Vigeland Park's sculpture gardens, and savour local cuisine at Aker Brygge. Discover the city's vibrant art scene and shop for Norwegian handicrafts. Overnight stay in Oslo"
   ]
  },
  {
   "day": 2,
   "title": "Explore Oslo using Oslo Pass | A Day to spend at your own pace",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "After breakfast, activate your Oslo Pass and explore the city at your own pace. It is your key to unlocking the treasures of Norway's capital. This all-in-one card grants you free access to Oslo's top museums and attractions, unlimited public transportation, and even discounts at restaurants. It's the perfect way to explore the city's cultural and historical wonders with ease. Afterwards, head back to your hotel for an overnight stay"
   ]
  },
  {
   "day": 3,
   "title": "A scenic Journey to Bergen | Norway in a Nutshell Tour",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "After breakfast check out from the hotel and head to the train station in Oslo to board the train to Myrdal station. The train encompasses a beautiful journey. Reach Myrdal station and get ready for the Flam Railway, one of the most scenic and steepest railways in the world. Reach Flam & board a scenic 2-hour fjord cruise to Gudvangen, including a trip through Nærøyfjord. Reach Gudvangen & board a bus to Voss. Next, take Bergensbanen train to Bergen. Overnight stay in Bergen"
   ]
  },
  {
   "day": 4,
   "title": "Bergen | Scenic Cruise to Mostraumen",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "After breakfast, embark on a roundtrip fjord cruise from Bergen to Mostraumen, sailing through the picturesque Osterfjord. Along the way, soak in the beauty of Bergen's colourful Bryggen wharf, mountainsides, cascading waterfalls, and the stunning Mostraumen strait. After the beautiful experience, head back to the hotel for an overnight stay"
   ]
  },
  {
   "day": 5,
   "title": "Fly To Tromso | Let your arctic adventure begins",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "After breakfast, check out from the hotel and head to the Bergen airport to catch a flight to Tromso. Reach the destination and head towards your pre-booked hotel. Proceed with the check-in formalities and spend the rest of the day at leisure. You can explore the Polaria Arctic experience centre, wander along the picturesque harbour, and taste fresh seafood at local eateries. Viisit the iconic Arctic Cathedral is a must for its stunning architecture. Overnight stay in Tromso"
   ]
  },
  {
   "day": 6,
   "title": "Tromso | Reindeer Sledding Tour & Chasing Northern Lights",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "After breakfast, head to the pickup point and get ready for the reindeer sledding tour for 10 minutes. Visit a reindeer camp, where you can interact with these graceful animals. In the evening, it's time to chase the Northern Lights in a small group tour. Head to the pickup location and hop on a bus for an exciting adventure amidst stunning scenery. After the tour, get dropped back at the pickup point and from there, head to the hotel. Overnight stay in Tromso"
   ]
  },
  {
   "day": 7,
   "title": "A Day at Leisure in Tromso",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "After breakfast, enjoy the day as you like. This is a day for self-exploration. You can plan your day by visiting the Tromsø Arctic-Alpine Botanic Garden, which showcases unique polar flora. You can also explore the Polar Museum to uncover tales of Arctic explorations. Stroll along the charming streets of Tromsø, discovering its vibrant cultural scene and enjoying local cuisine. Overnight stay in Tromso"
   ]
  },
  {
   "day": 8,
   "title": "Fly to Oslo | Departure",
   "city": "",
   "meals": [],
   "items": [],
   "prose": [
    "After breakfast, check out from the hotel and get transferred to the Tromso airport to catch a flight to Oslo. After reaching Oslo Airport, take a flight back home. Take a bag full of memories to cherish for eternity"
   ]
  }
